Z||000000||JSocha||08-18-2001||08:23 PM||||Everyone I'm back from the shortest camping trip in my history.<P>Wife decided to call in and check on the girls.  Then she called into work because the manager called.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">  I should kick her in the pants once in awhile, but I don't.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>The manager was supposed to work tomorrow morning, however, the lady that was supposed to work tonight never showed up, never called in and nobody knows where she is at.  So, because we couldn't make it back in time, the manager is working tonight and Janice has to take her shift tomorrow morning as schedules are being shifted because they think that she quit.<P>I should have never brought my stupid cell phone, but keep it just in case of emergency's or so the wife can check on the girls.<P>So here we are, trying to get close to nature as possible (in more ways then one) as we had a very private campsite only to be disrupted by this.<P>Threw everything in back of the truck and headed on home.  Unpacked, set up the tent and the girls are now cleaning it and may even sleep in it tonight just so they can wash it again tomorrow.<P>Wife is now upstairs in bed sleeping getting ready for tomorrow.  I'm here thinking how relaxing this weekend had started.<P>Well, anyways, HI Everybody...I'm back...not like you missed me or anything.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||8
